{"at":"2026-02-18T15:47:25.943Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":752,"status":"published","language":"es","path":"/es/docs/propertylist-mls-manual-de-usuario/verified-agency/","title":"Verified Agency","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMLS User Manual\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Verified Agency</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 2 minutes\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t789 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"14333\" class=\"elementor elementor-14333\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5895d71 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5895d71\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4294c4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4294c4b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"color: var(--p_color);\">Verified Estate Agencies</span></strong></p><p>Becoming a verified agency on <a href=\"https://propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> offers significant benefits for agents and agencies, enhancing your professional network and boosting your agency&#8217;s credibility. When agents fill out the necessary information, they receive a &#8220;Verified Check Mark.&#8221; This mark indicates that they are a registered company in their respective area.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-635e905 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"635e905\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-14341\" alt=\"Verified Estate Agencies - PropertyList\" srcset=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2.png 1000w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-300x300.png 300w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-150x150.png 150w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-768x768.png 768w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-20x20.png 20w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-32x32.png 32w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-70x70.png 70w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-16x16.png 16w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-40x40.png 40w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-50x50.png 50w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-12x12.png 12w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-60x60.png 60w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Untitled-design-2-18x18.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c05e653 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c05e653\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ae3def elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9ae3def\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Benefits of Becoming a Verified Agency:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Professional Recognition:</strong> The &#8220;Verified Check Mark&#8221; indicates that your agency is legitimate and recognised within the professional community.</li><li><strong style=\"color: var(--p_color);\">Check Mark on Properties:</strong><span style=\"color: var(--p_color);\"> Your properties will also display a check mark on the property page, indicating their verified status.</span></li><li><strong>Duplicate Properties: </strong>Your <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/duplicate-properties/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">duplicate listings</a> will be prioritised over a non Verified Agency&#8217;s listing.</li><li><strong>Verification Bonus:</strong> Upon verification, agencies will be awarded 20 Credits (equivalent to €20) for use on the platform!</li></ol><p><strong>Steps to Become Verified:</strong></p><ol><li>Add your company SL number</li><li>Provide your website</li><li>Link your social media account</li><li>Connect your Google Business account.</li></ol><p><strong>Each &#8220;Verified Check Mark&#8221; will link to your Google Reviews.</strong></p><p>By becoming a verified agency on PropertyList, you enhance your professional presence, connect with like-minded professionals, and build a reputation of trust and reliability within the industry.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9eeaa7f elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"9eeaa7f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-grow\" href=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/verify-your-agency/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Verify Your Agency Now</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94f607d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"94f607d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you have any questions or need further assistance in the verification process, please reach out to our <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/mls-support/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">support team</a>. We&#8217;re here to help you succeed!</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager first\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/credits/\">\r\n                    <span> MLS User Manual - Previous </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tCredits                </a>\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/reports-and-statistics/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - MLS User Manual </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tReports &#038; Statistics                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>","seo_title":"Verified Agency • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}